  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/znHQQtuU/images/653b6f24f05341edcd3cba3164edd0b8d2c0dd71.png\" alt=\"More Delight\" width=\"408\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p><strong>踏上更丰富的烹饪旅程</strong>。More Delight 是一款为 Farmer's Delight 设计的模组，增加了更多的餐点、刀具和食材。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-fabric/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"Download 26.1 update\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9HxDzV.png\" alt=\"Forge Download\" width=\"248\" height=\"36\"></a></p>\n<h2>🍽️ 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>通过新餐点和食材扩展你的菜单。</li>\n<li>利用面包片轻松制作三明治。</li>\n<li>享受由面包片制成的酥脆吐司。</li>\n<li>配备木刀和石刀，提升烹饪精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 兼容模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Expanded Delight</li>\n<li>Casualness Delight</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Some Assembly Required</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中许多食谱灵感来源于我女朋友所做的美味佳肴。<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"Saving for a laptop!\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Support Me Button\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Donate Button\"></a></p>",
